# Optional Environment Variables (Secrets)

## Real-Debrid API token: https://real-debrid.com/apitoken

## Deployment Hints for Cloudflare Dashboard

# RD_API_TOKEN=
# TORBOX_API_KEY=
# WEBDAV_USERNAME=
# WEBDAV_PASSWORD=
#
# Public mode requires all four values to remain unset.
# Private mode requires both WEBDAV values and a credential for each enabled
# provider. Every other combination fails closed with 503 Service Unavailable.

## Deployment Guide for Wrangler CLI

## wrangler secret put RD_API_TOKEN
## wrangler secret put TORBOX_API_KEY
## wrangler secret put WEBDAV_USERNAME
## wrangler secret put WEBDAV_PASSWORD
## wrangler deploy
